    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The UK "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Government",
            "zh": "英国政府"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " has made new rules to help animals in zoos live better and safer lives. These rules will be used in England, Scotland and Wales."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One rule says that elephants must live in much "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " places. Their homes should be more like the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "wild",
            "ref": "v-wild"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", so they have "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "enough",
            "ref": "v-enough"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " space to walk, play and be with other elephants."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Another rule says that "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "birds of prey",
            "zh": "猛禽"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", like eagles and owls, cannot be "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "tied",
            "zh": "系，拴"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "posts",
            "zh": "柱子"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " anymore. Instead, they will live in big "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "cages",
            "ref": "v-cage"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", so they can fly and move "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Zoos must also stop letting people "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " sea animals such as "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "rays",
            "zh": "鳐鱼"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "octopuses",
            "zh": "章鱼"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This is to keep both people and animals "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Zoo workers will get better "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "training",
            "ref": "v-training"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " so they can "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the animals well. Zoos will also do more to protect "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "endangered animals",
            "zh": "濒危动物"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that may disappear from the world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many people think these new rules are good news for animals. But some people say they are "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They believe wild animals, like elephants, should live free instead of in zoos."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
